FAQ #4 "How old is Duke Dennis?" carried `anchor: 'why-duke-dennis-calls-the-army-his-biggest-regret'` — a verbatim duplicate of FAQ #2's anchor. `FAQSection.svelte:38` renders `id={faq.anchor}` on each `<details>`, so this produced two elements with the same DOM id and deep-linked the age question to the Army-regret section. Changed to `'how-old-is-duke-dennis'`. All six anchors are now unique.

